  "goodToKnow": "Die Praktik, usually plural Praktiken, is a practice or method, often with a negative tone: fragwürdige Praktiken, illegale Geschäftspraktiken. For positive or neutral practice, German usually says die Praxis: in der Praxis (in practice), and a doctor's surgery is also die Praxis. Das Praktikum is an internship. These three P-words confuse many learners, so learn them together. Plural: die Praktiken."
